--- internal/config/doc.go
// Package config resolves where hseh keeps state and configuration: Herdr's
// managed plugin directories, the space definition directory, the hseh.toml
// settings file, and the environment-derived plugin id and socket path.
package config
--- internal/dirlist/doc.go
// Package dirlist renders a read-only directory listing for the picker
// preview: eza with fixed arguments when it is installed, otherwise a plain
// builtin listing. Nothing here is user-configurable.
package dirlist
--- internal/focus/doc.go
// Package focus keeps the most-recently-used history of workspaces and agent
// panes on disk, validated against the live Herdr server, and applies plugin
// lifecycle events to it.
package focus
--- internal/gitinfo/doc.go
// Package gitinfo summarises a checkout (branch plus counts of staged,
// modified, untracked, conflicted, ahead and behind) from git status.
package gitinfo
--- internal/herdr/doc.go
// Package herdr is the client for Herdr's unix socket API: the request
// protocol and its hedging, the session.snapshot types, the server continuity
// witness, plugin event decoding, and workspace, tab and pane mutations.
package herdr
--- internal/hsehtest/doc.go
// Package hsehtest holds test fixtures shared across hseh packages: an
// in-process fake of the Herdr socket server and helpers for writing space
// definitions and building the environment of a compiled hseh.
package hsehtest
--- internal/lockfile/doc.go
// Package lockfile serialises hseh processes with an exclusive flock on a
// path, retrying while another process holds it.
package lockfile
--- internal/picker/doc.go
// Package picker is the Bubble Tea popup: building and filtering items from a
// snapshot, rendering the list and preview, theme and sidebar configuration,
// and the list --json document.
package picker
--- internal/space/doc.go
// Package space implements reusable spaces: TOML definitions, their
// association with live workspaces, and the open and recover flows that
// create or focus them.
package space
--- internal/termtext/doc.go
// Package termtext removes terminal control sequences from text that came
// from a pane or a config file, either entirely or keeping only SGR colour.
package termtext
--- internal/trace/doc.go
// Package trace appends one line per timed event to the file named by
// HSEH_TRACE or trace_file in hseh.toml. When neither is set every hook is a
// nil check.
package trace

